cher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)"},{"type":"text","text":": a random session identifier held in memory only, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":" with the session’s duration."}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rest ship no manifest: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GRDBPersistence\/documentation\/GRDBPersistence"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Checksums\/documentation\/Checksums"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting"},{"type":"text","text":" neither call a required-reason API nor make data of their own. They carry, store and send the events and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context your app and the modules above make."}]},{"text":"Your app’s manifest and privacy labels","anchor":"Your-apps-manifest-and-privacy-labels","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Traffluent’s manifests cover what its modules make. Your app’s manifest and its App Store privacy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"labels also cover what your app adds:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your events."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Each event type your app tracks is data your app collects: declare the type its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties hold (Product Interaction for taps and views, Purchase History for an order, and so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your identifiers.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" An identifier your app adds with an enricher of its own, such as an account"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier, is a User ID, linked to the user ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/IdentifyingPeople","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your destinations.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" Where your destinations send records decides whether the data leaves the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"device, and whether a third party r